Fix cart system and header scroll flashing

Cart:
- Real cart state lifted to top-level with add/remove/qty controls
- Restaurant page: ADD button toggles, qty stepper (−/+) appears after
  first add, items can be removed entirely
- Checkout: renders actual cart items with inline qty controls and
  delete buttons, totals recalculate dynamically
- Tracking and confirmed screens reflect actual ordered items
- Empty cart state with redirect to browse

Header:
- Single sticky <header> element that switches between full and compact
  mode internally — eliminates the separate fixed overlay that caused
  flashing/double-render on scroll
- requestAnimationFrame-throttled scroll detection
